  "body": "If you’ve been searching for a standalone home that effortlessly combines luxury, comfort, and convenience, this is your opportunity.\r\n\r\nImagine living just a short stroll from top schools, beautiful beaches, vibrant shops, and local amenities—all while enjoying a peaceful, private setting.\r\n\r\nHere’s why you’ll love this home:\r\n• Freehold Title: Secure your investment with both CCC and new title ready—move in before Christmas!\r\n\r\n• No Society or Body Corporate Fees: Enjoy true independence and peace of mind.\r\n\r\n• Modern Layout: Four spacious bedrooms, 2.5 stylish bathrooms, and a single internal garage.\r\n\r\nThoughtful Design:\r\n• Downstairs: Light-filled open plan living and dining, guest powder room, and a generously sized laundry.\r\n• Upstairs: Master suite with private ensuite, plus three additional bedrooms and a separate family bathroom.\r\n• Low Maintenance: The manageable garden is perfect for busy lifestyles—simply lock up and leave.\r\n• Sought-After School Zones: Zoned for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Browns Bay School, and Northcross Intermediate.\r\n\r\nThere’s so much more to discover—this home truly needs to be seen to be appreciated.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this don’t come along often.\r\n\r\nWe warmly invite you and your family to schedule a private inspection and experience everything this exceptional home has to offer.\r\n\r\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, please contact us today.\r\n\r\nYour new beginning could be just a visit away!",
